// EVERY ITEM THE LOG LISTS, ONCE. The overall "Collection Log - X/Y" counts these: an item on
// two pages is one item, as in Old School. The pages themselves are dbrows; this exists only
// because "the distinct union of a list column over every row" is not a query dbtables have.

